{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"abibas-first-day","version":1,"title":"Abiba’s First Day","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"It was Abiba’s first day at school. She had a new uniform and a new bag. Her tummy felt wobbly. She felt nervous. ‘What if nobody likes me?’ she whispered.","sentences":["It was Abiba’s first day at school.","She had a new uniform and a new bag.","Her tummy felt wobbly.","She felt nervous.","‘What if nobody likes me?’ she whispered."],"alt":"A girl in a new uniform holds her mother’s hand at a school gate.","image":{"hash":"sha256:908bb50223b55d6455a160683711876f67e4d4f7a3335d58d3979093c9e1a0b8","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:937a4ae772980e071bf5c4671360e03089b4ee79bd61e659444868eee69cbffa","durationMs":19360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4293],[4293,8585],[8585,11599],[11599,14044],[14044,19360]],"words":[[0,284],[284,711],[711,1564],[1564,2274],[2274,2701],[2701,2985],[2985,4293],[4293,4719],[4719,5146],[5146,5288],[5288,5714],[5714,6709],[6709,7136],[7136,7278],[7278,7704],[7704,8585],[8585,9012],[9012,9723],[9723,10291],[10291,11599],[11599,12025],[12025,12594],[12594,14044],[14044,14612],[14612,14897],[14897,15750],[15750,16460],[16460,17199],[17199,17626],[17626,19360]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Mama knelt down. ‘Everyone feels a little scared on the first day,’ she said. ‘I will be back at home time.’ She gave Abiba a big hug.","sentences":["Mama knelt down.","‘Everyone feels a little scared on the first day,’ she said.","‘I will be back at home time.’ She gave Abiba a big hug."],"alt":"A mother kneels and hugs her daughter at the gate.","image":{"hash":"sha256:4b5a9ac83b7e92f98a8e053bbf4d7eef1b2132091eabaa46bdf96280b8ff8901","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:87e630fa16748fc8d7a8b6581a438df993f5ec0e8d91f4159cbb5dac039cfb6e","durationMs":13520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,1931],[1931,7988],[7988,13520]],"words":[[0,477],[477,1073],[1073,1931],[1931,2885],[2885,3481],[3481,3601],[3601,4316],[4316,5031],[5031,5270],[5270,5627],[5627,6223],[6223,6772],[6772,7130],[7130,7988],[7988,8107],[8107,8584],[8584,8823],[8823,9299],[9299,9538],[9538,10015],[10015,10873],[10873,11231],[11231,11708],[11708,12304],[12304,12423],[12423,12781],[12781,13520]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Madam Aduku met Abiba at the door. ‘Good morning, Abiba,’ she said. ‘We are glad you are here.’ Abiba sat down at a little desk. She did not say a word.","sentences":["Madam Aduku met Abiba at the door.","‘Good morning, Abiba,’ she said.","‘We are glad you are here.’ Abiba sat down at a little desk.","She did not say a word."],"alt":"A teacher welcomes a shy girl at a classroom door.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d09238c0dbc798bebf29706357fd4520f69b0df50f31569619227a0034428813","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:10dd50c087fae341d4837f146be208f56a21d1f14d3545b3eb1342a967a6bd69","durationMs":18000,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4175],[4175,8240],[8240,15207],[15207,18000]],"words":[[0,691],[691,1382],[1382,1797],[1797,2488],[2488,2765],[2765,3180],[3180,4175],[4175,4728],[4728,5917],[5917,6829],[6829,7244],[7244,8240],[8240,8516],[8516,8931],[8931,9484],[9484,9899],[9899,10313],[10313,11309],[11309,12000],[12000,12415],[12415,12968],[12968,13244],[13244,13382],[13382,14212],[14212,15207],[15207,15622],[15622,16037],[16037,16452],[16452,16866],[16866,17005],[17005,18000]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Everyone else seemed to know somebody. Abiba looked at her hands. She felt very small and alone.","sentences":["Everyone else seemed to know somebody.","Abiba looked at her hands.","She felt very small and alone."],"alt":"A girl sits alone at a desk looking at her hands.","image":{"hash":"sha256:82c87dab0684abfde45bfec6f6e9a8b6db2278ab1c52eaa95fc5d8f5f1c2bba1","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e22cbef444a7052869d558317c0cf31ed71e82971bda0174acf476a2b4bdac29","durationMs":11920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4845],[4845,8176],[8176,11920]],"words":[[0,1101],[1101,1652],[1652,2478],[2478,2753],[2753,3303],[3303,4845],[4845,5533],[5533,6359],[6359,6634],[6634,7047],[7047,8176],[8176,8589],[8589,9140],[9140,9690],[9690,10378],[10378,10791],[10791,11920]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Then a boy sat down beside her. His name was Kwartei. He had a box of crayons. ‘Do you want to draw with me?’ he asked. ‘You can have the red one.’","sentences":["Then a boy sat down beside her.","His name was Kwartei.","He had a box of crayons.","‘Do you want to draw with me?’ he asked.","‘You can have the red one.’"],"alt":"A boy offers a red crayon to a girl at a shared desk.","image":{"hash":"sha256:ee08f0b57947d65fffd865c81bfa15c343a16fb6a39c468e92c755a4a5989753","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:781fa9959386e83c6a092e2345e8ab837109dc9acb228b2132df90651dece6f1","durationMs":15280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3320],[3320,5785],[5785,8372],[8372,12571],[12571,15280]],"words":[[0,488],[488,610],[610,976],[976,1342],[1342,1831],[1831,2563],[2563,3320],[3320,3686],[3686,4174],[4174,4540],[4540,5785],[5785,6029],[6029,6395],[6395,6517],[6517,6883],[6883,7127],[7127,8372],[8372,8616],[8616,8982],[8982,9471],[9471,9715],[9715,10203],[10203,10691],[10691,11326],[11326,11570],[11570,12571],[12571,12937],[12937,13303],[13303,13791],[13791,14157],[14157,14523],[14523,15280]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Abiba took the red crayon. She drew a house. Kwartei drew a sun. They drew and drew. Abiba smiled a little smile.","sentences":["Abiba took the red crayon.","She drew a house.","Kwartei drew a sun.","They drew and drew.","Abiba smiled a little smile."],"alt":"Two children draw a house and a sun together.","image":{"hash":"sha256:fadb281b602d339a6844e436148691cf02c0eadd03870c05819af59eb03f8ca6","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:3a333c5bfc725786f023b9f73de90da16515544012d9d0bc97d319b76ac7702c","durationMs":16800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3947],[3947,6590],[6590,9558],[9558,12527],[12527,16800]],"words":[[0,816],[816,1468],[1468,1957],[1957,2447],[2447,3947],[3947,4437],[4437,5089],[5089,5252],[5252,6590],[6590,7731],[7731,8384],[8384,8547],[8547,9558],[9558,10210],[10210,10863],[10863,11352],[11352,12527],[12527,13342],[13342,14321],[14321,14484],[14484,15463],[15463,16800]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"After break, Madam Aduku taught them a song. Abiba sang it too, quietly at first, then louder. She knew all the words by the end.","sentences":["After break, Madam Aduku taught them a song.","Abiba sang it too, quietly at first, then louder.","She knew all the words by the end."],"alt":"A class sings together while a girl sings loudly and smiles.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b883def0c8f097b48d9536e343d16147b12f36127ac5bdb2514ae986796e3da7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e273222627d15e573af143625ab7b0162c20df9587b353de30305f0a6546c974","durationMs":15280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5363],[5363,11345],[11345,15280]],"words":[[0,674],[674,1563],[1563,2237],[2237,2910],[2910,3719],[3719,4258],[4258,4393],[4393,5363],[5363,6037],[6037,6576],[6576,6845],[6845,7465],[7465,8408],[8408,8678],[8678,9567],[9567,10106],[10106,11345],[11345,11750],[11750,12289],[12289,12693],[12693,13097],[13097,13771],[13771,14040],[14040,14445],[14445,15280]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"At home time, Mama was waiting at the gate. ‘Mama!’ said Abiba. ‘I made a friend! His name is Kwartei. And I know a new song!’ The end.","sentences":["At home time, Mama was waiting at the gate.","‘Mama!’ said Abiba.","‘I made a friend!","His name is Kwartei.","And I know a new song!’ The end."],"alt":"A girl runs to her mother at the school gate with a drawing in her hand.","ima